; Always Max CPU Speed (Nokia E72 RM-530 v091.004)
; Keeps the CPU at the top speed step all the time (the OS no longer lowers it when idle).
; Target: Z:\sys\bin\dvfs_hal.dll - the function that returns the max performance level requested by the policies now always returns 100%.
; Side effects: faster battery drain, warmer phone. Disable the patch in RomPatcher+ to go back to normal.
; If the phone hangs or restarts: remove the battery and start again (the patch lives in shadow memory, so a restart is clean).
; Made for the OverDrive app: enable this patch first, then apply the clock.

